    {
      "uid": "zhcn:144611430db47f226bf14d51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄昏时分，\n在餐厅前思索着晚餐该吃什么时，\n我遇见了千明代表和她的父母。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5ba99f9187fb1e92c31348a67bfde20e962f5c3ceec16857a8eab9430893133",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
